OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThrough the
OL,6,Fevening and overnight it will be
OL,7,Fmostly cloudy, but with some clear
OL,8,Fintervals most likely in the east.
OL,9,FBreezy near the coasts. Not quite as
OL,10,Fcold as the previous night, but still
OL,11,Fa touch of rural frost possible.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FIt will be a mostly dry and
OL,14,Fcloudy day but with some bright
OL,15,Fintervals breaking through,
OL,16,Fparticularly in the east. A few
OL,17,Fshowers possible in the evening. Windy
OL,18,Fat times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
